      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here\u0027s what I\u0027m thinking in msdc_ops_request():\n\nstatic void msdc_ops_request(struct mmc_host *mmc, struct mmc_request *mrq)      \n{                                                                                \n        struct msdc_host *host \u003d mmc_priv(mmc);                                  \n                                                                                 \n        host-\u003eerror \u003d 0;                                                         \n        WARN_ON(host-\u003emrq);                                                      \n        host-\u003emrq \u003d mrq;                                                         \n                                                                                 \n#ifdef CONFIG_MMC_CRYPTO                                                         \n        if (mrq-\u003ecrypto_key_slot \u003e\u003d 0) {                                         \n                /*                                                               \n                 * TODO: Are we really alright with rejecting a 0 data_unit_num? \n                 */                                                              \n                if (unlikely(!mrq-\u003edata_unit_num)) {                             \n                        mrq-\u003ecmd-\u003eerror \u003d -EINVAL;                               \n                        mmc_request_done(mmc, mrq);                              \n                        return;                                                  \n                }                                                                \n                if (msdc_set_crypto(host, mrq-\u003edata_unit_num,                    \n                                    (mrq-\u003edata-\u003eflags \u0026 MMC_DATA_WRITE))) {      \n                        mrq-\u003ecmd-\u003eerror \u003d -EINVAL;                               \n                        mmc_request_done(mmc, mrq);                              \n                        return;                                                  \n                }                                                                \n        }                                                                        \n#endif                                                                           \n\nThe last argument of msdc_set_crypto() is changed to \u0027bool enc\u0027:\n\nstatic int msdc_set_crypto(struct msdc_host *host, u64 data_unit_num, bool enc);",
